1:00,55,,,Easy
1:00,100,,110,High cadence 2/3
1:00,55,,,Easy
1:00,100,,110,High cadence 3/3
1:00,55,,,Easy
5:00,105,,,Blow out
10:00,50,,,Easy
20:00,,,,20 minutes all out (free)
10:00,60,40,,Cool down
